ctronic Systems Engineer - Software</div> <p class="fixed-job-panel__company">Cummins Inc.</p> </div> <div class="fixed-job-panel__actions"> <div class="job-apply job-apply-2489642" id="job-apply-2489642"> <div class="apply-row"> <button class="colored brand-cyan round btn btn-apply action-job-apply
